{"v":4,"catch":"經典原創的高速追逐動作遊戲！","desc":"《Route16》是一款於 1981 年推出的街機動作遊戲。\n\n在廣闊的迷宮中奔馳，一邊閃避敵方車輛，一邊收集散落於關卡中的所有道具。\n當你陷入危機時，奪取旗幟即可一舉逆轉局勢！\n\n透過可即時切換的「迷宮模式」（Maze Mode）與「雷達模式」（Radar Mode），在複雜的迷宮與由 16 個迷宮構成的整體關卡之間自由切換，帶來緊張刺激的追逐動作體驗。","publisher":"SUNSOFT","release":"2026-08-06","genres":["動作","競速","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","義大利文","韓文","中文 (簡體)","中文 (繁體)"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"普遍級","size":"Switch 2 0.2GB / Switch 0.2GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/8ac4cf198ecac20da89cd913329f9e2ecb3d8afcabc5c8a4d6dee65046e3e584.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a893cd2b098bf0870c8d0023506b1f903decc88cc8d691d8d815e25e51665b7a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/14685c6c8ff015d3f89a741bfa8628275cd671bc4cb2ecea4cd60eff12716d02.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/b14825c09ddc81f39e316b4534f67d082adaefc543736133e38eb4306abf843c.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/100e04f5ce71f1b6644a5bc01aefec1b31df480f0e859abccfa4c97d74054e71.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/bb6171494868d16bd8729c06d048a01d200c0abf303b99329222b9ef7e962b5b.jpg"],"titleId":"0100758027a56000","dlc":[]}